# Local crash / self-test logs are written to %TEMP%/%APPDATA%, not the repo,
# but ignore any stray copies just in case.
cascade_crash.log
cascade_selftest.log
# Squad: ignore runtime state (logs, inbox, sessions)
# Note: .squad/casting/* is identity and MUST be committed to main, not ignored
.squad/orchestration-log/
.squad/log/
.squad/decisions/inbox/
.squad/sessions/
.squad/.scratch/
.squad/.cache/
# Squad: GitHub automation is intentionally disabled in this repo.
# `squad upgrade` unconditionally rewrites .github/workflows/ from the CLI's
# template dir with no opt-out, so these are ignored rather than merely deleted.
# Ignoring them means an upgrade can recreate them locally but they can never be
# committed, never reach GitHub, and never trigger. Delete them after any upgrade.
.github/workflows/squad-*.yml
.github/workflows/sync-squad-labels.yml
.github/copilot-instructions.md
# Squad: SubSquad activation file (local to this machine)
.squad-workstream
